---
layout: base.njk
title: About
description: Jane Doe is a designer and developer working with small teams on product design and front-end.
permalink: /about/
---
<header class="page-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>Hi, I'm {{ site.name }}.</h1>
</header>

<div class="about">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lede">
      I'm a designer who writes the code, which mostly means fewer handoffs and
      fewer surprises between the mock-up and the thing people actually use.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started out building websites for a small studio, spent four years
      leading design on a mobile product, and now work independently with teams
      who want one person to carry an idea from research to release.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside work I draw maps, row badly, and keep a notebook of interfaces that
      got one small thing exactly right.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/contact/">Say hello &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>

  <section aria-labelledby="experience">
    <h2 id="experience">Experience</h2>
    <ol class="timeline">
      {%- for job in experience %}
      <li>
        <p class="when">{{ job.years }}</p>
        <h3>{{ job.role }}</h3>
        <p class="org">{{ job.org }}</p>
        <p>{{ job.summary }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
</div>
